<Snapshot background="#0B1220" type="png"><Container width="1600" height="1000"><Stack alignment="TOP_LEFT" clipBehavior="HARD_EDGE"><Positioned left="0" top="0"><Container width="1600" height="5" color="#F43F5E"/></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="20"><Text fontSize="34" color="#EAF1FB" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">三线换乘 · 网络示意图</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="64"><Text fontSize="19" color="#A7B6CC" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">非地理示意图：只表达相邻关系与换乘，拓扑距离不代表实际距离；相邻站间耗时相同、可双向乘车。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="980" top="22"><Text fontSize="18" color="#6E8098" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">图例</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="980" top="52"><Container width="34" height="8" color="#F43F5E" borderRadius="4"/></Positioned><Positioned left="1022" top="42"><Text fontSize="18" color="#A7B6CC" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">R 红线</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="1096" top="52"><Container width="34" height="8" color="#3B82F6" borderRadius="4"/></Positioned><Positioned left="1138" top="42"><Text fontSize="18" color="#A7B6CC" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">B 蓝线</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="1212" top="52"><Container width="34" height="8" color="#10B981" borderRadius="4"/></Positioned><Positioned left="1254" top="42"><Text fontSize="18" color="#A7B6CC" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">G 绿线</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="980" top="74"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6E8098" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">线路用颜色 + 字母双重编码，不依赖红绿色差</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="980" top="98"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6E8098" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">○ 有设施　⊘ 无设施（可乘车通过，不可作起终点或换乘站）</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="980" top="122"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6E8098" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC">◎ 换乘站（两线共用）　线段交叉无站点处不构成换乘</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="32" top="152"><Container width="1536" height="1" color="#1B2840"/></Positioned><Positioned left="114.5" top="594.5"><C